<p>Increases weapon damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%</acronym> and physical power by 30 when using swords, axes, maces, knives, or bows.</p><p>You now also use your Magic in place of Strength when equipping weapons and ammo as well as when calculating weapon damage.</p><p>These bonuses override rather than stack with weapon mastery, dagger mastery, and bow mastery.</p>